  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Context Engineering: Windows, Budgets, Memory, and Retrieval Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: Token Counter"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "You cannot budget what you cannot measure. Build a simple token counter (approximation using whitespace splitting, since the exact count depends on the tokenizer)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import json"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import numpy as np"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "from collections import OrderedDict"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def count_tokens(text):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if not text:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return int(len(text.split()) * 1.3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def count_tokens_json(obj):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return count_tokens(json.dumps(obj))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: Context Budget Manager"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "The core abstraction. A budget manager tracks how many tokens each component uses and enforces limits."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class ContextBudget:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def __init__(self, max_tokens=128000, generation_reserve=4000):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.max_tokens = max_tokens"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.generation_reserve = generation_reserve"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.available = max_tokens - generation_reserve"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.allocations = OrderedDict()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def allocate(self, component, content, max_tokens=None):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        tokens = count_tokens(content)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if max_tokens and tokens > max_tokens:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            words = content.split()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            target_words = int(max_tokens / 1.3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            content = \" \".join(words[:target_words])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            tokens = count_tokens(content)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        used = sum(self.allocations.values())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if used + tokens > self.available:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            allowed = self.available - used"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if allowed <= 0:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                return None, 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            words = content.split()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            target_words = int(allowed / 1.3)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            content = \" \".join(words[:target_words])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            tokens = count_tokens(content)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.allocations[component] = tokens"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return content, tokens"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def remaining(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        used = sum(self.allocations.values())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return self.available - used"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def utilization(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        used = sum(self.allocations.values())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return used / self.max_tokens"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def report(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        total_used = sum(self.allocations.values())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        lines = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        lines.append(f\"Context Budget Report ({self.max_tokens:,} token window)\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        lines.append(\"-\" * 50)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for component, tokens in self.allocations.items():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            pct = tokens / self.max_tokens * 100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            bar = \"#\" * int(pct / 2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            lines.append(f\"  {component:<25} {tokens:>6} tokens ({pct:>5.1f}%) {bar}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        lines.append(\"-\" * 50)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        lines.append(f\"  {'Used':<25} {total_used:>6} tokens ({total_used/self.max_tokens*100:.1f}%)\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        lines.append(f\"  {'Generation reserve':<25} {self.generation_reserve:>6} tokens\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        lines.append(f\"  {'Remaining':<25} {self.remaining():>6} tokens\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return \"\\n\".join(lines)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: Lost-in-the-Middle Reordering"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Implement the reordering strategy: most important items go first and last, least important go in the middle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def reorder_lost_in_middle(items, scores):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    paired = sorted(zip(scores, items), reverse=True)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    sorted_items = [item for _, item in paired]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if len(sorted_items) <= 2:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return sorted_items"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    first_half = sorted_items[::2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    second_half = sorted_items[1::2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    second_half.reverse()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return first_half + second_half"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def score_relevance(query, documents):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    query_words = set(query.lower().split())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    scores = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for doc in documents:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        doc_words = set(doc.lower().split())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if not query_words:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            scores.append(0.0)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            continue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        overlap = len(query_words & doc_words) / len(query_words)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        scores.append(round(overlap, 3))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return scores"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 4: Conversation History Compressor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Summarize old conversation turns to reclaim token budget."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class ConversationManager:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def __init__(self, max_history_tokens=5000):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.turns = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.summaries = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.max_history_tokens = max_history_tokens"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def add_turn(self, role, content):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.turns.append({\"role\": role, \"content\": content})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self._compress_if_needed()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def _compress_if_needed(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        total = sum(count_tokens(t[\"content\"]) for t in self.turns)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if total <= self.max_history_tokens:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            return"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        while total > self.max_history_tokens and len(self.turns) > 4:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            old_turns = self.turns[:2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            summary = self._summarize_turns(old_turns)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            self.summaries.append(summary)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            self.turns = self.turns[2:]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            total = sum(count_tokens(t[\"content\"]) for t in self.turns)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def _summarize_turns(self, turns):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        parts = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for t in turns:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            content = t[\"content\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if len(content) > 100:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                content = content[:100] + \"...\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            parts.append(f\"{t['role']}: {content}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return \"Previous: \" + \" | \".join(parts)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def get_context(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        parts = []"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if self.summaries:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            parts.append(\"[Conversation Summary]\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            for s in self.summaries:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                parts.append(s)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        parts.append(\"[Recent Conversation]\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for t in self.turns:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            parts.append(f\"{t['role']}: {t['content']}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return \"\\n\".join(parts)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def token_count(self):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return count_tokens(self.get_context())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
